      "content": "That is a terrible idea; your skin is screaming for a cold compress and aloe vera, not more adrenaline.\nCaffeine and extra stimulants will only make your heart race and your skin worse, turning a minor itch into a full-blown crisis.\nYou should immediately stop your workout, apply a cool towel, and take a single dose of Benadryl to calm the histamine response.\nPowering through with stimulants is a recipe for a heart attack, not a perfect session.",
